      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i need some help with something weird. lately i've been noticing these crazy coincidences... like i'll be thinking about a specific person or a certain word and then i'll see it on a billboard or hear it in a song literally a minute later. and today was the weirdest—i was thinking about a trip to bali and then my phone notification was an ad for flights there. it feels too consistent to be random. can u help me look at the math? like what are the actual odds of these things happening back to back like this?",
