    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what u mean about pattern seeking but it feels different than just \"thinking i see patterns.\" it's like the universe is actually responding to my thoughts. like, if i focus really hard on a goal, the world starts rearranging itself to show me that i'm on the right track. it's not just a coincidence if it happens every single time i'm in that headspace. don't u think there could be some kind of connection between my mental state and the stuff i'm seeing? like a way that my focus actually influences what's around me?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
