      "content": "but isn't it possible that \"science\" just hasn't figured out how to measure consciousness and its impact on the field yet? like, there's so much we don't know. if i'm telling you that this happens every time i'm in a specific mindset, it's not just a one-off fluke. it feels like i'm tapping into some kind of mechanism... like i've mastered the laws of synchronicity or something. if the math says it's \"impossible\" but it's happening to me constantly, doesn't that mean the math is missing a variable? like, my intent?",
